1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Parking brake wouldn't release

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,000
after a cold night?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
One rear wheel dragging,

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
a burning smell, or the car pulling.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
One clue: the parking brake cable,

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
rusted or frozen inside its housing.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
A stuck cable can keep that wheel

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
partly engaged — wearing it faster.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess. A quick check

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
can free the cable or catch it early.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before one dragging wheel becomes a bigger repair.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
